{"quest_id": 4154, "name": "大長老の奮起　極級", "description": "竜人の侵攻を食い止めよ！\n＜王子の称号が「攻撃アップ系」で攻略が\n有利になります＞\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "modifier_notes": ["王子の称号が「攻撃アップ系」で攻略が\n有利になります"], "event": "アンナの大冒険", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920029, "map_no": 5379, "level": 105, "multiplier": 1.05, "charisma": 25, "exp": 240, "gold": 1000, "drops": [{"card": 96, "c": 1}, {"card": 95, "c": 1}, {"item": 1002, "c": 1}, {"card": 97}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1050, "attack": 525, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098512, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 112, "global_id": 111, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 630, "attack": 315, "base_hp": 600, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 49, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098576, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 147, "global_id": 146, "spawn_sec": 29}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 8400, "attack": 630, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 350.0, "dot_rate": 1.75, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2098560, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 591, "global_id": 590, "spawn_sec": 38}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 630, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 600, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 170, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098640, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 151, "global_id": 150, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 40}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1365, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 1300, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098208, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 5, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 70, "global_id": 69, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 0, "to_global_id": 533, "spawn_sec": 43}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1365, "attack": 368, "base_hp": 1300, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 211, "move_speed": 700.0, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098208, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 4, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 534, "global_id": 533, "from_condition": 0}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 8400, "attack": 630, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.75, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2098560, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 146, "global_id": 145, "spawn_sec": 53}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "この大穴は、まさか……！", "face": "l2d04745ddd90"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "……あ！　お主らは！　丁度よい！\n頼む、わしの同胞を止めてくれぬか！？\nもはやわしの言葉は届かんようなのじゃ……。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あなたは……竜人の大長老！", "face": "l2d04745ddd90"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "今わしはあやつらを止めていたところじゃ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "千年戦争からわしらは敵として刃を交えておった。\nしかしそれはもう過去の話……。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "今は既に、そのような時代ではない。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "わしら種族の数も減ってきている今、\nいがみ合うだけ無駄なのじゃ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "それよりも共存し、お互いの種の繁栄を\n目指さねばならぬ時。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "……だが、一部の竜人たちはそうもいかぬ。\nあやつらのように共存に反対し、武力をもって\n制しようとする者たちもおる。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "今では竜人を二分する勢力争いにまで発展し、\nあやつらは別勢力を作りおった。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "わしも歳が歳じゃからのぅ。\n政治的な力が衰えたことにも起因しておろう。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "しかし此度その別勢力が、軍隊を率いて\n勝手に地上への侵攻を開始しおったのじゃ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "わしは何とかしてそれを止めねばならん。\nこれ以上は無益な争いにしかならぬ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そんなことが……。\nでしたら私たちも協力いたします。", "face": "l2d04745ddd90"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "頼む。\nお主ら人間とわしら竜人は\n共存の道を歩むべきなのじゃ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "大長老", "text": "ようやくあやつらを説得できたか……。\nしかし、同族で刃を交える事は\nもうしたくないものじゃ……。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "大長老様っ、ご無事ですか！？", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "おお巫女よ。\nわしはこの通り無事じゃ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "良かったです！\n大長老様がこの様に身をていして\n争いを阻止してくださるなんて……。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "人間を忌み嫌っておられた頃とは\n随分変わられました。\n私、嬉しいです……っ。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あなたあの時の……！", "face": "l2d04745ddd90"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "お久しぶりです。\nあの時は大変お世話になりました。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "竜人の国を飛び出して追われていた\n私を助けてくれましたよね……。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "あの時、人間はやっぱり優しいんだ、\n私の思ってた事は間違ってなかったんだって\n確信しました。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "あの時王子が助けてくれなかったら、\n人間と竜人は今でもずっと\n戦い続けていた事でしょう……。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "うむ。あの時の巫女の行動がなければ\n戦いは続き、数に劣る竜人の敗北に\n終わっておったろう……。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "わしも歳をとったものじゃ。\n地下に閉じこもって旧知の同胞達といるばかりで、\n因縁という鎖にとらわれておった。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "今のこの世は混沌でしかありません。\n魔物達の秩序もなくなっています。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "エキドナ", "text": "英雄の血を引く王子ならば、\nきっと世界を平和にしてくれる。\n私たちは今そう思っております。", "face": "u98"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "王子よ、世話になったな。\nわしも種族をまとめられるように、\n生きてる限り手を尽くすつもりじゃ。", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "大長老", "text": "こんな老兵でも、やれる事はある。\nまだ若いもんに負けるわけにはいかんじゃろ？", "face": "l1f842c648542"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "竜人と人間、今度は互いに手を取り合う番です。\n共存できる世界になるよう、頑張りましょう！", "face": "l2d04745ddd90"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920029_5379", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 682, "y": 151}, {"k": "b", "x": 550, "y": 64}, {"k": "b", "x": 856, "y": 254}, {"k": "m", "x": 506, "y": 279, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 541, "y": 318, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 320, "y": 307, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 340, "y": 343, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 216, "y": 319, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 248, "y": 367, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 363, "y": 147, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 281, "y": 173, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 225, "y": 231, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 319, "y": 463, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 438, "y": 505, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 543, "y": 475, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 629, "y": 450, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 468, "y": 111, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 603, "y": 237, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 869, "y": 333, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 722, "y": 423, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 847, "y": 453, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 440, "y": 327, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 415, "y": 291, "id": 219}, {"k": "r", "x": 277, "y": 261, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 323, "y": 209, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 412, "y": 187, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 452, "y": 241, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 363, "y": 255, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 355, "y": 397, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 445, "y": 380, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 520, "y": 372, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 610, "y": 351, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 583, "y": 407, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 499, "y": 436, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 420, "y": 440, "id": 311}]}, "start_cost": 20, "active": true, "story_talk": true, "name_en": "Grand Elder's Resolve Extreme", "description_en": "Stop the Dragonfolk invasion!\n<Prince's title “Attack Up” makes the run easier>\nExtreme (★1 target: Avg Lv25)"}